# The blanket *.json above swallows the Claude Code project config. settings.json is
# checked in because it registers the dog-fooding PreToolUse hook - without it the hook
# is inert on a fresh clone and enforcement silently doesn't exist. settings.local.json
# stays ignored: it's per-machine (absolute paths, personal permission grants).
!.claude/settings.json

